sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as RouteSearchUI
  participant NM as NavigationManager
  participant LT as LocationTracker
  participant GC as GeofenceChecker
  User->>UI: "이 경로로 안내" 선택
  UI->>NM: startNavigation()
  NM->>LT: useGeolocation(true)
  loop 위치 갱신마다
    LT-->>NM: onLocationUpdate(coords)
    NM->>GC: geofenceLeg(stops, coords)
    GC-->>NM: { nearestIdx, nearestDist, alightDist }
    NM->>NM: arriveAt(nearestIdx)
    NM-->>User: 현재 위치/남은 정류장 수 갱신
  end
